WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.058 --> 00:00:12.808
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:18.915
(upbeat music)

00:00:20.558 --> 00:00:22.068
- [Voiceover] And here they come stomping

00:00:22.068 --> 00:00:24.124
straight into the base of Kentucky.

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.775
- [Voiceover] Robert Morris
University in Chicago

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:28.393
has recognized that esports is massive,

00:00:28.393 --> 00:00:30.655
with over 130 million people tuning in

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:34.047
around the world to watch
digital athletes compete.

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:35.902
That's why they're the first US college

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:38.381
to offer varsity gaming scholarships.

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:42.381
Now, there's a whole new
kind of jock on campus.

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:28.664
- My name is Kurt Melcher,

00:01:28.664 --> 00:01:30.812
I'm the executive director of esports

00:01:30.812 --> 00:01:32.614
at Robert Morris University.

00:01:32.614 --> 00:01:35.441
I really come from a
traditional athletic background

00:01:35.441 --> 00:01:37.785
but I've also at that same time always been

00:01:37.785 --> 00:01:39.353
in love with video games.

00:01:39.353 --> 00:01:42.026
That's when it hit me that
we could offer scholarship

00:01:42.026 --> 00:01:44.392
and get the best League
of Legends players,

00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:45.772
and run it the same way as

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.425
we do any of our athletic programs.

00:01:48.425 --> 00:01:49.765
Some of the technical requirements

00:01:49.765 --> 00:01:53.195
to have varsity level is
definitely is bandwidth specific.

00:01:53.195 --> 00:01:54.937
We work closely with our IT department

00:01:54.937 --> 00:01:57.318
to make sure that we would have no lag,

00:01:57.318 --> 00:01:58.785
no issues with Internet.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.937
I think they doubled our
bandwidth for the university

00:02:00.937 --> 00:02:02.839
just to make sure that we're not gonna

00:02:02.839 --> 00:02:04.398
be overloading the system,

00:02:04.398 --> 00:02:06.485
and, you know, affecting other classrooms.

00:02:06.485 --> 00:02:09.068
(upbeat music)

